10
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:33,370
This movement

11
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:35,250
It won't lead to loss, right?

12
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:59,700
Show when in stock

13
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:01,140
Nothing is blank
